Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, watch as we pass by,\Nas we raise our flag, up high in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.71,0:00:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,here we go now, sailing through the\Nendless ocean, facing all that comes by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look for our treasure. Nobody has\Never got to witness with their own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is keep\Nbelieving in our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And let our heart lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then once we got all that,\Nall there's left is to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When we face the dark and stormy weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.38,0:00:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the pace, we'll\Nlink our hearts together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm sure we'll make it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.48,0:00:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.14,0:00:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Still raising our flag as we journey on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:00:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Though our chances are close to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't back down from anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.70,0:01:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase.\NLet's start up the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Toward our own dreams\Nwhile keeping the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With a compass pointing to our goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't stop till we've\Ngone around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.38,0:01:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Start me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.32,0:01:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.58,0:01:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll never stop,\Ntill we're at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.54,0:01:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that we'll ever quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep heading for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase.\NLet's start up the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I see through your eyes,\Nwhat we'll have to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.58,0:01:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All the memories will stay in our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let them go. Brand new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.58,0:01:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.68,0:02:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.44,0:02:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.35,0:02:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me we're on\Nthe hunt for two keys now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.94,0:02:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,One for Robin and those two bozos?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.24,0:02:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How stupid can this get?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, at least I know\Nhow deep of a hole we're in
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.80,0:02:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You've really got me fired up now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.49,0:02:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He just won't stay down. Talk about tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.42,0:02:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll show you tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.62,0:02:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroyer cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.80,0:03:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you shouldn't do it then!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.74,0:03:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.57,0:03:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a six powers master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.84,0:03:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No bullet can move as quickly as I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.58,0:03:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how much\Nyou run around or how fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's practically impossible\Nfor anyone to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.02,0:03:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,my Franky Destroyer Cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.04,0:03:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,These aren't just any cannons, they're\Nloaded with tracking cannonballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, tracking cannonballs?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.94,0:03:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he mean they're cannonballs that\Ncan sense their target and track it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never even heard\Nof technology like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.92,0:03:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:03:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.74,0:04:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean all the tracking is done by you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you still run that damn fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.86,0:04:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I letting this idiot\Nchase me around like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.70,0:04:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, he disappeared again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.20,0:04:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.90,0:04:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Searching for me is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a master of the shave technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.56,0:04:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With its power, not only am I\Nfaster than the speed of lightning,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.30,0:04:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm also completely silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.18,0:04:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like an owl,\Npatiently hunting its prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.52,0:04:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I ALWAYS carry out a\Nflawless assassination!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.68,0:04:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like an owl, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.80,0:04:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.71,0:04:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My target doesn't realize I'm upon\Nthem until the moment of their death!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:04:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He was hiding over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.78,0:05:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, all that bragging\Nwas real stealthy of ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.62,0:05:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cocky jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you humiliate me like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.04,0:05:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No one humiliates CP9 and labs!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.86,0:05:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.96,0:05:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.90,0:05:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.16,0:05:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, we're over the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The current's too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.96,0:05:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll drag him straight to the waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do\Nto help him in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.78,0:05:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:05:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Swim with all your might!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha-ba-ba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just use my moonwalk if I go over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.78,0:06:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.69,0:06:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hardly move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.76,0:06:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a damn strong current,\Nand I'm gonna run out of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.20,0:06:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doubly screwed here. Cha-ba-ba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.18,0:06:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hurry up and drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.94,0:06:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.10,0:06:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He busted out of the fridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.40,0:06:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.94,0:06:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so full!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, he got fat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.70,0:06:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you eat every piece of food in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.42,0:06:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't have any\Ndesire to die today!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.58,0:06:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already at the base end!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:06:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.91,0:07:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fall! Don't go over!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.36,0:07:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Rick! Butterfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha-pa-pa-pa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You are going over that\Nwaterfall! No more!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Solid pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.62,0:07:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugly bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.32,0:07:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons left!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.88,0:07:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat this! Ha! Paper art!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.18,0:07:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.98,0:07:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:07:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:07:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.90,0:08:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to get to shore pronto!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One liter cola cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.20,0:08:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Udaboo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Joppa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.19,0:08:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't learn your lesson, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.94,0:08:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It takes more than strength\Nto defeat a six powers master!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.70,0:08:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong hammer! Keep her off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.50,0:08:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now fall over the edge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.46,0:08:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.74,0:08:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.02,0:08:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.30,0:08:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do the moonwalk with one\Nfoot when I'm carrying someone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.64,0:08:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna make us fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:09:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I realize that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.88,0:09:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell you what, I'll let go of your lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.26,0:09:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,After you've taken me back to shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.82,0:09:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We can fight it out on land.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you can put all your\Nenergy into fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,me right now and see where that gets us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I prefer the first option.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.20,0:09:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I'm going down those\Nfalls, you're coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.80,0:09:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You and me, we're in the same boat here,\Nso why don't we just go back to shore?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.90,0:09:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job, that's some fine kicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.12,0:09:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.52,0:09:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there. Keep at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.20,0:09:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Chubba-ba, just so you know, this battle\Nis gonna end as soon as we're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.00,0:09:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that a fact?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I just remembered a\Nlittle technique of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.82,0:09:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's sure to finish\Nyou off in a single blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.94,0:09:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes two of us, Fukuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:10:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's your plan now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take me to shore already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.10,0:10:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna hurry up and knock you\Nout and get this over with?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of your talking Sick of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna shut you up right here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.72,0:10:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Super cartwheel, fire and fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to slam you into the\Ntower and smash you to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that would pulverize\Nme, gotta give you that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, center!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.06,0:10:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got both your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I've got you bound\Nlike this, you can't move around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.46,0:10:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,At the speed we're going, there's\Nnothing you can do to slow us down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.80,0:10:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,70-millimeter caliber cola cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.68,0:10:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little coot-a-bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.36,0:10:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He thugs our momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.94,0:11:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not even rotating anymore. Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.86,0:11:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.56,0:11:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We're right above the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.82,0:11:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.12,0:11:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,70-millimeter caliber,\N1.5 bats, Call power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.98,0:11:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.54,0:11:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.30,0:11:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give up already, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.54,0:11:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido! Bum!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.12,0:11:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is that number two key?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorrel, I'm finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.22,0:11:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.52,0:11:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a piggyback! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tempest kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.56,0:12:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Finger pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.86,0:12:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play innocent with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You were just pretending\Nto fire that kick at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.12,0:12:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You were aiming for me, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.42,0:12:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the most paranoid\Naccusation I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But I will admit, you have\Nbeen getting in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you want to fight, I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.10,0:12:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been getting in my\Nway, you stupid herbivore!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.90,0:12:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I like meat just as much as the next guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.70,0:12:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.61,0:12:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always wondered about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you just ask me the other day who\Nyou think is stronger, a giraffe or a wolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact is that wolves\Naren't much more than cunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.56,0:12:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But beyond that, they aren't exactly\Nthe most capable of creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.96,0:12:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.96,0:12:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the final straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So you want to do this right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.06,0:12:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That kind of distraction won't last\Nlong enough for us to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.86,0:12:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.77,0:12:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I sure hope you have\Nsome sort of backup plan then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.94,0:12:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:12:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,has to chop off his own hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.32,0:13:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the most terrifying\Nidea I've ever heard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.98,0:13:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done explaining, just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.16,0:13:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The first thing we do\Nonce we get these cuffs
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.36,0:13:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,off us is run like hell\Nuntil we find Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.10,0:13:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,With his medical expertise,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.50,0:13:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll be able to sew the hand back\Non in no time at all, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.72,0:13:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not ragdolls!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.60,0:13:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got another plan to\Nget us out of this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.16,0:13:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even want to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to settle\Nthis with words alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.12,0:13:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to go when you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.82,0:13:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And let's up the stakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.00,0:13:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner gets to keep\Nthe prey all to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.86,0:14:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Sniper King,\Njust hold that posture.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.32,0:14:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You are now a sewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone get me a lawyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.82,0:14:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no way I am not going\Nto sue your ass off for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.60,0:14:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.92,0:14:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.83,0:14:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever seen\Nanyone with so little self-control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.38,0:14:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You gained all that weight\Nin just a few minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.88,0:14:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your concern, but I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.44,0:14:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.56,0:14:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said I'm concerned about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.32,0:14:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk with food in your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That is indeed what I was trying to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're\Ntrying to do, but stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.52,0:14:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're okay, I'm okay, everything's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.26,0:15:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.50,0:15:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Where was I again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall solve this shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.04,0:15:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.32,0:15:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My life returns!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Digest!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Absorb!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.20,0:15:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.84,0:15:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.75,0:15:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.06,0:15:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.70,0:15:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, could you do it again, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A life return!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.82,0:15:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The Digest!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.22,0:15:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That comes off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.66,0:15:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.18,0:15:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.62,0:15:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how kind of you to ask!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.04,0:15:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand years at sea, a\Nthousand years in the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.28,0:15:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,breathing in the wind, than\Ndrinking the morning dew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.32,0:15:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I lived as a hermit to\Ncomplete my training, and lo,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.96,0:16:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,at long last, the secrets of life\Nreturn revealed themselves to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,From your head down to your toes,\Nevery inch of the human body?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.92,0:16:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,can be controlled with\Nthe strength of will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.80,0:16:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you can even command your internal\Norgans and each hair to its very tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Using the mind to control\Nthe workings of the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.68,0:16:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've read about something\Nsimilar in a medical journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.60,0:16:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They called it biofeedback.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're able to move your hair around\Nlike an octopus because of that power?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Yo-yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.18,0:16:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,An octopus?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.28,0:16:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I am, as you say,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.20,0:16:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,a CC!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.82,0:16:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A valiant lion, in other words!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.42,0:16:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Octopus, lion, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.64,0:16:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Life return!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.08,0:17:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And hair bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.84,0:17:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-yo-yoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.28,0:17:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If I get caught by his\Nhair, it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.88,0:17:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Finger pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.64,0:17:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He did that with a blunt stick?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.08,0:17:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron body!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.42,0:17:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it. I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:18:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless I can hit him with arm point or\Nhorn point, he's not going to budge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.02,0:18:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But the rumble balls are powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.14,0:18:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,One in six hours is\Nabout all I can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.28,0:18:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Any more than that will put\Ntoo much strain on my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.00,0:18:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Even worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.80,0:18:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,if I take another, I might not be able\Nto control my transformations anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.86,0:18:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If I still can't win and\NI have to take a third,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I might completely lose consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.26,0:18:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it worth it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.74,0:18:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I could\Ndamage him without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.76,0:18:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall skewer you and roast you alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.22,0:18:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Chess, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.46,0:18:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to think this over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.94,0:18:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumble!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.32,0:19:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a risk, but it's the only\Nchance I've got to do or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.72,0:19:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,One way or another, I have to\Nsettle this in three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.82,0:19:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.18,0:19:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.58,0:19:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shishikabob!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.25,0:19:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Jumping point!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.38,0:19:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.56,0:19:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-yo-yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yo-yo-yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.74,0:19:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.96,0:19:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.40,0:19:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My transformations are messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.84,0:19:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need is to get to arm point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.30,0:19:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,One shot with a cloven\Nhoof should be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.36,0:19:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If this fire keeps spreading,\NI'll end up suffocating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.68,0:19:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't waste time fighting this\Nguy when he doesn't even have a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.74,0:20:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.66,0:20:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to find key number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro and Sniper King are counting on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.34,0:20:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't save Robin without their help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.40,0:20:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.44,0:20:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.32,0:20:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to save my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.36,0:20:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not going to let\Nanybody get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.06,0:20:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a stubborn beast, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Life return!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.88,0:20:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,His hair is pointing at me. Who cares? I\Ndon't have time to think. I have to win.
